{"path":"experimental/fs/path/operator=","title":"std::experimental::filesystem::path::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::filesystem::path::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/fs/path/operator=","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-fs_ts\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">path<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> path<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> p <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-fs-ts t-mark-ts\">(filesystem TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-fs_ts\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">path<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> path<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> p <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-fs-ts t-mark-ts\">(filesystem TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-fs_ts\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Source <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>path<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Source<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> source <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-fs-ts t-mark-ts\">(filesystem TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Replaces the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> with a copy of the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Replaces the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code>, possibly using move semantics: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code> is left in valid, but unspecified state.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Replaces the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> with a new path value constructed from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">source</span></code> as if by overload <span class=\"t-v\">(4)</span> of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/fs/path/path\">path constructor</a>. Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">assign<span class=\"br0\">(</span>source<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> p\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a path to assign\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> source\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\">std::basic_string</a></span>, pointer to a null-terminated character/wide character string, or an input iterator that points to a null-terminated character/wide character sequence. The character type must be one of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char16_t</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char32_t</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span></span></code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> (none)</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <div class=\"t-noexcept-inline\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/noexcept_spec\"><code>noexcept</code></a> specification:&nbsp;&nbsp;<div class=\"t-noexcept-box\"><span class=\"t-cc\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span></span></span></div>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> (none)</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;experimental/filesystem&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> fs <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">path</span> p <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"C:/users/abcdef/AppData/Local\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    p <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> p <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Temp\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// move assignment</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> wstr <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> L<span class=\"st0\">\"D:/猫.txt\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    p <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> wstr<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// assignment from a source</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/fs/path/assign\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>assign</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  assigns contents <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/fs/path/path\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a <code>path</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/fs","title":"Filesystem library"},{"path":"experimental/fs/path","title":"std::experimental::filesystem::path"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::filesystem::path::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations. Replaces the contents of *this with a copy of the contents of p."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"p, source"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"assign","note":"assigns contents"},{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs a path"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":193,"codeBlockCount":1}
